+   run positive and negative Rabinowitsch controls.  Stop at nine minutes or
+   4 GB and print `COUNTING-BOUND/TIMEOUT`, never `EMPTY` by wrapper.
+
+This is decisive in the campaign sense: either it gives the first exact
+coefficient obstruction on a live screened degree, or it isolates the
+smallest correction mode that defeats the proof attack and becomes the best
+counterexample seed.  The software acceleration is the joint
+(mathbf Z/(k+1))-character and Newton-weight emission.  It replaces one
+dense Gröbner call by sparse linear pages and a much smaller residual ideal.
+
+Once a genuine edge packet exists, global moments should also be accelerated
+by **tree contraction**, not expansion into all labelled branches.  A child
