+
+\[
+T_{v,a}^{(j,h)}=[t^h]\sum_{i\in a}{H_i(\tau_i-w_v)^j\over D_i};
+\]
+
+the parent combines them by binomial centre translation, shared outer units,
+and character projection.  At the root the messages reproduce the exact
+moments.  Validate this contraction against brute interpolation on two small
+controls before using it at (D=108).  It is an implementation of the same
+global equations, not a new rank theorem.
