+  carry a level dictionary.  Keep the language only as the dual bookkeeping
+  of the coefficient complex.
+- **25 — LOWER.**  The Hurwitz expected dimension is
+  (max(k-2,0)\ge0) everywhere.  Exact passports remain a cheap local
+  prefilter and the 19 rigid cases remain targets, but dessin combinatorics is
+  not the all-degree endgame.
+- **26 — RAISE, retyped.**  Not as a primitive-monodromy ceiling.  The exact
+  local cyclic action, fixed root, nonzero (A_j)-orbits, and orbit
+  partitions are indispensable state in `C_FULL_TREE` and in the coefficient
+  scheme.  Do not infer global primitivity from them.
+- **36 — RAISE.**  Structured exact search finally has a legitimate target:
+  a screened full tree at (D=108), or its tree-inherited
+  ((18,12;\gamma^3)) descendant.  This is not random sparse support search;
+  a rational solution of the full original Keller system would be a
